     1	# Gröbner–Shirshov bases of finite-type Artin groups on the Artin–Garside alphabet
     2	
     3	Status labels follow README.md: PROVED (complete written proof here), COMPUTED+VERIFIED
     4	(computer-assisted, exact, reproducible; proof structure written here, computation in `work/`,
