   189	$R_3$ is (G4); $R_4$ follows from $R_3$ ($x\Delta=\Delta\varphi(x)\Rightarrow\Delta^{-1}x=\varphi(x)\Delta^{-1}$,
   190	then replace $x$ by $\varphi(x)$). Each right side is deg-lex smaller (shorter, or same length with
   191	first letter $\Delta^{\pm1}<x$); deg-lex is a monomial well order, so rewriting terminates.
   192	No leading word is a factor of another (positive words of length $m$ vs. length-2 words containing
   193	$\Delta^{\pm1}$), so there are no inclusion compositions. All intersection compositions
   194	(overlaps $w=\bar f c=d\bar g$, $|\bar f|+|\bar g|>|w|$):
