    11	                                                  Abstract. In this paper, we give a Gröbner-Shirshov basis of the braid group
    12	                                                  Bn+1 in the Artin–Garside generators. As results, we obtain a new algorithm
    13	                                                  for getting the Garside normal form, and a new proof that the braid semigroup
    14	                                                  B + n + 1 is the subsemigroup in Bn+1 .
