     9	- **This is a literature survey, not a verification of the papers' composition calculations.** “Opened PDF” means the abstract and relevant theorem/presentation passages were read, usually through the accompanying `pdftotext -layout` file. “Opened abstract” is weaker. Metadata alone is explicitly **[UNVERIFIED]** for mathematical content.
