   132	   - The in-book search `Artin` returned “No results found”; this is **not** reliable proof of absence because it is a limited preview/search index. No non-A Artin theorem or updated open-problem declaration was verified in the opened portion. **The unviewed book is [UNVERIFIED] for such a claim.** Therefore this book is not used to certify either solution or continued openness.
   133	   - Access attempts: World Scientific book page and write-up endpoint returned 403; Google Books API ISBN query returned 429; accessible HTML preview returned 403; the ordinary interactive Google Books preview worked. No purchase/sign-in was performed, and no complete copyrighted book was downloaded.
   134	5. **SCNU group check:** opened the [faculty listing](https://maths.scnu.edu.cn/shizhi/yjsds/) and [Chen's 2018 CV/publication list](https://statics.scnu.edu.cn/pics/userfiles/2018/0620/20180620103813693.pdf). The live individual profile was blocked by the site. The CV confirms [CZ13], the 2014 survey, and later algebra-focused work, but is dated and not a complete 2026 bibliography. It was saved as `chen-2018-scnu-cv.pdf`.
