   147	- **Xing Chen and Xuezhi Zhao**, *Normal forms in braid groups with respect to some Gröbner–Shirshov basis*, *Journal of Knot Theory and Its Ramifications* 29(13) (2020), 2043005, [DOI:10.1142/S0218216520430051](https://doi.org/10.1142/S0218216520430051). **Opened DOI abstract.** Derives concrete irreducible/normal-form expressions from **Bokut's 2008 ordinary-braid Artin–Garside basis**. No non-A extension is claimed in the opened abstract. No OA PDF located.
   148	- **Usman Ali and Barbu Berceanu**, *Canonical forms of positive braids*, *Journal of Algebra and Its Applications* 14 (2015), 1450076, [DOI:10.1142/S0219498814500765](https://doi.org/10.1142/S0219498814500765). **Opened DOI abstract.** Consequences of the positive ordinary-braid GS basis (canonical/square-free forms, exponents and divisibility), not a non-A group theorem.
